-- title:
--   Unramified complete DVR extension as A₀[X]/(P) modulo all 𝔪ⁿ
-- statement:
--   Let $A_0$ be a discrete valuation ring (a commutative domain with the discrete valuation ring structure) and let $W_0$ likewise be a discrete valuation ring which is complete (and Hausdorff) for the adic topology of its maximal ideal, equipped with an $A_0$-algebra structure whose structure map $A_0 \to W_0$ is a local homomorphism. Assume the extension is unramified in the strong sense that $\mathfrak m_{W_0} = \mathfrak m_{A_0} W_0$, i.e. the maximal ideal of $W_0$ is the ideal generated by the image of the maximal ideal of $A_0$, and assume the residue field extension $\kappa(W_0)/\kappa(A_0)$ is finite and separable. Then there exist a polynomial $P \in A_0[X]$ and an element $\theta \in W_0$ such that: $P$ is monic; its reduction $\bar P \in \kappa(A_0)[X]$ along the residue map is irreducible and separable; $P(\theta) = 0$; for every $n \in \mathbb N$ and every $w \in W_0$ there is $g \in A_0[X]$ with $w - g(\theta) \in \mathfrak m_{W_0}^n$; and for every $n \in \mathbb N$ and every $g \in A_0[X]$, $g(\theta) \in \mathfrak m_{W_0}^n$ holds if and only if $g$ lies in the ideal sum $(P) + \mathfrak m_{A_0}^n A_0[X]$, the second summand being the ideal of $A_0[X]$ generated by the image of $\mathfrak m_{A_0}^n$ under the constant-coefficient embedding $C$.
--
--   This is the standard presentation of an unramified extension of discrete valuation rings by a single étale-generating equation: the last two clauses say exactly that $A_0[X]/(P) \to W_0$ induces isomorphisms $A_0[X]/(P, \mathfrak m_{A_0}^n) \cong W_0/\mathfrak m_{W_0}^n$ for all $n$, so that $W_0$ is the adic completion of the standard étale $A_0$-algebra $A_0[X]/(P)$. It is used to construct ring homomorphisms out of $W_0$ into adic completions, in [`IsLocalRing.exists_ringHom_adicCompletion_of_isDiscreteValuationRing_of_maximalIdeal_eq_map_of_residueField`](thm.html#IsLocalRing.exists_ringHom_adicCompletion_of_isDiscreteValuationRing_of_maximalIdeal_eq_map_of_residueField).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsDiscreteValuationRing_exists_monic_aeval_eq_zero_forall_mem_pow_iff_of_maximalIdeal_eq_map_of_isSeparable.lean

